<div class="pg-section" id="section-7">
  <h3 class="pg-section-title">Reference</h3>
  <div class="docs-table-wrap">
    <table class="sui-table sui-table-compact">
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Class / Attribute / Key</th><th scope="col">Description</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>sui-speed-dial-br</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-bl</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-tr</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-tl</code></td><td>Fixes the dial 24px from a viewport corner (bottom-right, bottom-left, top-right, top-left); left and right flip in RTL.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>sui-speed-dial-relative</code></td><td>Keeps the dial in the page flow instead of fixed to the viewport, as in these demos.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>sui-speed-dial-down</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-left</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-right</code></td><td>Direction the actions open (default up).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>sui-speed-dial-hover</code></td><td>Opens on hover as well as on click.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>sui-speed-dial-sm</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-lg</code></td><td>Smaller or larger trigger and actions.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>sui-speed-dial-success</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-danger</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-warning</code>, <code>sui-speed-dial-info</code></td><td>Trigger colour (default primary).</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>data-label</code></td><td>On an action: tooltip text shown on hover and focus.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>aria-label</code></td><td>Accessible name for icon-only actions without <code>data-label</code>.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>.open</code></td><td>Set by softui.js when the trigger is clicked, which also updates <code>aria-expanded</code>; clicking an action or outside the dial removes it.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><kbd class="sui-kbd-inline">Esc</kbd></td><td>Closes an open dial and returns focus to its trigger.</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
